idity but that really took her out  of context didn't it  right rochelle wensley the cdc director  said that 75 of covid cases of the death  that we've seen from kovid were involved  four or more comorbidities so it meant  that they were seriously ill now many on  the right took that to mean that the  official covet death toll that we have  in america is seriously inflated  um of course what rochelle willinski  actually said was that in a particular  uh  trial and study  of cova deaths among the vaccinated 75  were seriously ill so she was making a  point that the vaccines are actually  working incredibly well not that the  total cova deaths that we've seen in  america are inflated by you know 75  percent so a terrible job of editing abc  really bad job of editing and abc news  has been caught doing this before where  they've edited something to make it  shorter and have ended up removing  necessary context from an interview so  they've run into this problem before and  uh they certainly got a lot of criticism  for it this week they absolutely did and  they deserve to be called a loser for  that aidan mclaughlin thank you so much  for being with us and that is our  program for tonight  thanks for joining us and thanks to our  team here at law and crime as we begin  the third year of our program brian ross  investigates we'll see you again next  week  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  you
 

